      "round_summary": "Repair round 1/3: Fix output_stable_when_idle DUT timing bug. Root cause: oReg and busyReg updated on same clock edge, so io.o changed simultaneously with module becoming idle. Fix: change io.o assignment (line 82) to Mux(done, combinational_result, oReg) so the correct GCD result is visible combinationally when done fires, one cycle before busyReg goes low. This ensures io.o is already stable when the module becomes idle. The oReg register still captures the result for holding after done goes low. All assertion labels preserved unchanged.",
