      "round_summary": "Repair round 2/3: Fix two assertion_error properties (done_clears_busy, load_sets_busy). Root cause: assertNextStepWhen generates broken SVA (missing antecedent + next-cycle implication) because when(cond) { fvAssert(...) } in Chisel produces a concurrent assert property without the antecedent. Fix: replace assertNextStepWhen(done, !busyReg, ...) with assertImplies(RegNext(done), !busyReg, ...) and similarly for load. assertImplies generates !antecedent || consequent (SVA: antecedent |-> consequent), and RegNext provides the 1-cycle delay. This yields correct SVA: donePrev |-> !busyReg = done |=> !busyReg. Both assertion labels preserved exactly. Homologous assertion load_sets_busy repaired identically.",
